// Overrides of the properties of the blocks and the items of the base game. Every `*.ron` of this
// folder is read, at start and again once one is saved (or on `/reload`), by the server, which
// sends them to its players. A file with an error changes nothing: the error goes to the log and
// to the chat.
//
// Blocks and items are named as the commands name them (`oak_log`), and so are the items a block
// drops. The fields (`shared/src/content/files.rs` lists them all): `light`, `opacity`, `break`
// (the hits of a hand), `tools`, `needs_tool`, `drops` (chance, item, count), `look`,
// `collision`, `outline`, `replaceable`; for an item `stack`, `attack_damage`, `food_value`,
// `food_effect`, `horse_armour`, `durability`, `category`.
//
// (
//     blocks: {
//         "torch": (light: 10),
//         "stone": (break: 20, tools: [Pickaxe], drops: [(1, "gravel", 1)]),
//     },
//     items: {
//         "apple": (stack: 16),
//     },
// )
()
